{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bee O' Factory is a colony-sim farm based game, where you provide guidance to a species of natural space colonizers called sproutlings. Now stranding on a forain planet, it is you task to help them to get back to their mother on their home planet.</strong>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gather!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/chopping.gif?t=1744145247\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take advantage of whateaver resource you can find in nature, create complex machinery and build your auto-suficient colony.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Produce!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/crops.gif?t=1744145247\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you don't care, who will? Resources are finite, so use all the tools in your holster to make sure you can survive with what is available, or even create your own renewable source!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Endure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/seasons.gif?t=1744145247\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Every season comes with a new set of challenges, overcome all of them and conquer the world.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/housing.gif?t=1744145247\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nature is hostile, so seek shelter and protect! Build from simple villages, to highly advanced cities, all while providing confort to all your sproutlings.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3374790?t=1744145247","backg